{"id":"615556","name":"白萝卜豆腐粉条包子","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/615556/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"一个"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"一块"},{"name":"粉条","amount":"一把"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水(40度左右)","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱","amount":"六根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆腐切厚片。","img":"images/615556/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"炸好的豆腐备用。","img":"images/615556/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切丁。","img":"images/615556/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"白萝卜洗净，削皮，擦丝。","img":"images/615556/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"淖一下，捞出，挤出多余水分，切一下。","img":"images/615556/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"红薯粉条备用。","img":"images/615556/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"清水泡20分钟，捞出，切一下，如图所示。","img":"images/615556/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"葱切碎。","img":"images/615556/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"白萝卜、油炸豆腐、粉条和葱放入盆中。","img":"images/615556/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加适量盐、少许老抽、五香粉和味精，浇上一勺热油，拌匀即可。","img":"images/615556/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"面粉中加酵母和温水，搅拌成絮状，醒发两倍大，揉成光滑面团，搓成长条状，切成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/615556/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"擀成中间厚四周薄的包子皮。","img":"images/615556/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/615556/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"已包好。","img":"images/615556/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"冷水上笼。","img":"images/615556/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"大火烧开转中火蒸十五分钟，关火焖五分钟。","img":"images/615556/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"已蒸好。","img":"images/615556/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/615556/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"软软的，掰开香味扑鼻，好吃过瘾！","img":"images/615556/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}